message: "Please cite the Aspis Spend manuscript and the q18/g37 mainnet release."
title: "Aspis Spend: Transparent Shielded-Spend Verification and Atomic State Update from a Pre-Uploaded Proof Account on Solana"
type: software
version: "aspis-spend-q18-g37-mainnet-v1"
date-released: 2026-07-16
