abstract: >-
  Aspis demonstrates transparent, trusted-setup-free verification of a
  one-input/one-output shielded-spend state transition entirely on Solana L1.
  The q18/g37 release finalized on mainnet-beta at 1,344,003 compute units and
  includes the proof, deployed SBF, transaction evidence, security analysis,
  and an offline-verifiable release bundle. The repository also contains a
  Lean 4 formalisation and the later source-authentic V5 Tag-67 candidate.
